  "solution": "Given equation: 11 ÷ 8 – 78 × 6 + 37 = ?\n\nNow, if ‘+’ and ‘-‘ and ‘×’ and ‘÷’ are interchanged, then:\n\n⇒ 11 × 8 + 78 ÷ 6 - 37 = ?\n\n⇒ __**11 × 8**__ + __**78 ÷ 6**__ - 37 = ?\n\n⇒ __**88 + 13**__ - 37 = ?\n\n⇒ __**101 - 37**__ = __**64**__\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 1\".",
